sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as HITL Agent
    participant H as Human Approver

    U->>A: Submit request
    A->>A: Analyze input & detect uncertainty

    alt Uncertain
        A->>U: HUMAN_APPROVAL_REQUIRED + audit log
        U->>H: Forward approval request
        H->>U: Provide clarification
        U->>A: human_input
        A->>A: Update context & audit
        A->>U: RESUMED + updated audit log
    else Confident
        A->>U: Completed action + audit log
    end
